    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RoA</strong> is a captivating multiplayer Action RPG set in a vibrant fantasy world teeming with life, challenges, and opportunities. Dive into dynamic dungeons filled with powerful bosses, mythical creatures, and hidden treasures. In Alurya, the journey is yours to shape, whether you choose to master combat, explore mysterious biomes, or build a thriving legacy through crafting, farming, and trading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hero, you'll harness unique abilities, form alliances, and collect powerful loot that enhances your character's potential. Experience an immersive gameplay loop that blends fast-paced action with strategic progression systems. In addition to its engaging single-player experience, RoA offers cooperative multiplayer modes where teamwork is essential to conquer the most challenging content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500760/extras/5bb3dc1776c5a005afd13191d78c2863.poster.avif?t=1740151061\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500760/extras/5bb3dc1776c5a005afd13191d78c2863.webm?t=1740151061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500760/extras/5bb3dc1776c5a005afd13191d78c2863.mp4?t=1740151061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Dungeons:</strong> Procedurally generated challenges that offer fresh experiences every time you enter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet System:</strong> Capture, train, and battle with companions, each with their own strengths and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island Management:</strong> Claim your own piece of Alurya and customize it with crafting, farming, and resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights:</strong> Face off against legendary bosses that test your skills and teamwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Economy:</strong> Trade resources, gear, and collectibles with other players in a robust marketplace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500760/extras/3417ce83d140dfb906253531993e2920.avif?t=1740151061\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RoA</strong> is a captivating multiplayer Action RPG set in a vibrant fantasy world teeming with life, challenges, and opportunities. Dive into dynamic dungeons filled with powerful bosses, mythical creatures, and hidden treasures. In Alurya, the journey is yours to shape, whether you choose to master combat, explore mysterious biomes, or build a thriving legacy through crafting, farming, and trading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hero, you'll harness unique abilities, form alliances, and collect powerful loot that enhances your character's potential. Experience an immersive gameplay loop that blends fast-paced action with strategic progression systems. In addition to its engaging single-player experience, RoA offers cooperative multiplayer modes where teamwork is essential to conquer the most challenging content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500760/extras/5bb3dc1776c5a005afd13191d78c2863.poster.avif?t=1740151061\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500760/extras/5bb3dc1776c5a005afd13191d78c2863.webm?t=1740151061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500760/extras/5bb3dc1776c5a005afd13191d78c2863.mp4?t=1740151061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Dungeons:</strong> Procedurally generated challenges that offer fresh experiences every time you enter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet System:</strong> Capture, train, and battle with companions, each with their own strengths and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island Management:</strong> Claim your own piece of Alurya and customize it with crafting, farming, and resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights:</strong> Face off against legendary bosses that test your skills and teamwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Economy:</strong> Trade resources, gear, and collectibles with other players in a robust marketplace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500760/extras/3417ce83d140dfb906253531993e2920.avif?t=1740151061\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
